# ==============================================================================
# SIH 26189 AI-Assisted Criminal Network Analysis System - Environment Configuration
# ==============================================================================
# IMPORTANT: All values provided here are SAFE DEVELOPMENT DEFAULTS.
# NEVER commit real credentials, production secrets, or real PII to source control.
